sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant User as 👤 用户
    participant Core as ⚙️ Core Loop
    participant Memory as 💾 Memory
    participant Guard as 🛡️ Guardrails
    participant Sales as 🤖 Sales Actor
    participant Tools as 🔧 Tools
    participant Intent as 🎯 Intent Classifier
    participant DB as 🗄️ Database

    Note over User,DB: 🔵 实时对话链路 (同步)
    User->>Core: 发送消息
    Core->>Memory: 获取用户画像 (DISC)
    Memory-->>Core: UserProfile
    Core->>Guard: 合规检查
    Guard-->>Core: ✓ 通过
    Core->>Sales: 生成话术
    Sales->>Tools: 调用保费计算
    Tools-->>Sales: 计算结果
    Sales-->>Core: 返回回复
    Core->>Memory: 保存对话历史
    Core-->>User: 💬 实时回复

    Note over User,DB: 🟠 异步状态更新 (非阻塞)
    Core->>Intent: 提交对话窗口
    Intent->>Intent: 分析客温 + 漏斗状态
    Intent->>DB: 更新状态
    DB-->>Memory: 状态同步

    Note over User,DB: 🟢 离线批处理 (定时)
    loop 每日/每小时
        DB->>Intent: 批量分析历史
        Intent->>DB: 更新 DISC 画像
    end

    Note over User,DB: ⚖️ 离线评测 (定期)
        DB->>Core: 读取日志进行评测
        Core->>Core: LLM-as-a-Judge 打分
        Core->>DB: 保存评测报告
    end
